  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "statement": "Define the sequence of positive integers \\(a_{n}\\) recursively by \\(a_{1}=7\\) and \\(a_{n}=7^{a_{n-1}}\\) for all \\(n \\geq 2\\). Determine the last two digits of \\(a_{2007}\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
