    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2007-p1.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "43. Note that the last two digits of \\(7^{4}\\) are 01. Also, \\(a_{2006}=7^{a_{2005}}=(-1)^{a_{2005}}=-1=3\\) \\((\\bmod 4)\\) since \\(a_{2005}\\) is odd. Therefore, \\(a_{2007}=7^{a_{2006}}=7^{3}=43(\\bmod 100)\\).",
